    {
      "source": "The <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>Connection</code></a> for the supplied <code>DataSource</code> will be\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/Connection.html#commit()\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\">committed</a> if it is not configured for\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/Connection.html#getAutoCommit()\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>auto-commit</code></a> and is not\n<a href=\"../DataSourceUtils.html#isConnectionTransactional(java.sql.Connection,javax.sql.DataSource)\">transactional</a>.",
      "translation": "为提供的 <code>DataSource</code> 创建的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>Connection</code></a>，如果未配置为\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/Connection.html#getAutoCommit()\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>auto-commit</code></a> 且不是\n<a href=\"../DataSourceUtils.html#isConnectionTransactional(java.sql.Connection,javax.sql.DataSource)\">transactional</a>，则会被\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/Connection.html#commit()\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\">committed</a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
